[[Monsters]] can have [[modifier]]s alike [[item]]s, [[strongbox]]es and [[area]]s. All modifiers can be divided into several groups: [[Monster modifiers#Implicit modifiers|implicit]], [[Monster modifiers#Explicit modifiers|explicit]] (or affixes &ndash; prefixes and suffixes), [[Monster modifiers#Torment modifiers|torment]] and so on.

