==Explicit modifiers==
{{c|magic|Magic}} monsters have one affix; {{c|rare|rare}} monsters have three affixes{{Citation needed}}, one of which may be an aura. This system is similar to [[Rarity#Items|rarity on items]], in that magic monsters have their affix added to their name and rare monsters are given a randomly generated name. For more information see [[Rarity#Monsters]].

Certain modifiers may be exclusive to magic or rare monsters, and may not appear in areas such as [[Delve]] or [[The Forbidden Sanctum|Sanctum]].

